	(text "Flashlamp drivers (sol. 17-24): IPD90N10S4L-06 DPAK, latch U3 output HIGH = lamp ON, clocked by /SOL 2 (J113-9). Sol 17-20 keep an on-board S1M tie-back to +20V\n(the A-12697 has none there); the sol 21-24 tie-back cathodes are brought out to J126-10..13 exactly like the A-12697 D9-D12, so the harness chooses the clamp rail.\nOn STTNG sol. 17/18 drive the 12 V gun motors (motor high side on the +12V power rail of J118) through this group.\nOutputs on J126 (playfield, key pin 9) and J125 (backbox, key pin 4). Flasher supply +20V on J107-5/6 / J106-5."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "44205081-7988-4ca9-ab49-31bfd32f8059")
	)
